{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4444 is a role-based dungeon crawler\u00a0where you control four characters at once in real time combat. Juggle tanking, dealing damage and healing your allies in fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 unique classes (expanding!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill swapping for character-wide and team-wide synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on handcrafted dungeons with randomized elements and branching paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After alien creatures freeze the world to extract our humanity, you develop telekinetic powers and begin to fight back controlling their frozen bodies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000600?t=1759044887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000600?t=1759044887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000600/c6300c3f9f422013c9941dafe658834eea30b088/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759044887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000600/c6300c3f9f422013c9941dafe658834eea30b088/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759044887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4011890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4444 is a role-based dungeon crawler\u00a0where you control four characters at once in real time combat. Juggle tanking, dealing damage and healing your allies in fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 unique classes (expanding!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill swapping for